# Vercel uses this INSTEAD of .gitignore when deciding what to upload.
#
# Why it exists: config.js holds the Mapbox + MapKit tokens and is gitignored
# (kept out of the repo), but production needs it or the map silently falls back
# to Esri imagery. Listing our own excludes here — and NOT config.js — means
# `vercel --prod` uploads it while git still ignores it.

.git
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
node_modules
.env
.env.*
